# Large distribution artifacts — not stored in git.
# Full bundle (with the vector index) is downloadable from https://acqagent.ai
# Basic bundle is attached to the GitHub Release.
gao-bid-protest-nexus-basic.zip
gao-bid-protest-nexus-full.zip

# Vector index — 146 MB + 229 MB, both over GitHub's 100 MB file limit.
# Ships in the full bundle; vector/meta.json is tracked.
vector/chunks.jsonl
vector/embeddings.npy

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Resolved gao.gov PDF links — a local cache written by scripts/resolve_pdfs.py
# and by the server's "find PDF". Run it with --apply to bake the links into
# data/mapped-decisions.json and visualization/map.html, which are tracked.
data/pdf-links.json

# Working files for scripts/vectorize.py: the downloaded decision PDFs and the
# text extracted from them. ~5,900 PDFs, several GB. The index built from them
# (vector/chunks.jsonl, vector/embeddings.npy) is ignored above.
corpus/
